<!--
  modules/core/pom.xml — Stage 2-f Task 4 module POM (Wave D)
  (docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-20-stage2f-remaining-modules.md).

  STATUS: ADDITIVE and RUN BY HAND (mvn -pl modules/core -am package from the
  reactor root, or mvn -f modules/core/pom.xml package). Ant (modules/core/
  build.xml + build.incl.xml) remains the real build; nothing here is wired
  into CMake or any release build yet.

  WHY THIS MODULE. Part of Wave D — four modules whose only unmigrated-wave
  dependency was gui (Wave C, now in the reactor). core is the smallest of
  the four (3 source files: Scilab.java — Scilab's actual application
  entry-point / bootstrap class, reached reflectively by NAME from several
  other modules' ruled-out Class.forName findings in earlier stages —
  plus ConsoleTab.java and ConsoleTabFactory.java) but pulls in six reactor
  dependencies plus flexdock, because Scilab.java wires up the whole
  application shell (menu bar, tool bar, console window, docking layout).

  STEP 1 FINDINGS (./maven-module-deps.sh core, 3 files):
    [1] imports (excluding core's own package):
      - org.flexdock.docking — ConsoleTab.java's real import (DockingConstants,
        DockingManager, both also used fully-qualified — see below).
        thirdparty/flexdock-1.2.5.jar, below.
      - org.scilab.modules.action_binding.highlevel — Scilab.java imports
        ScilabInterpreterManagement.
      - org.scilab.modules.commons{,.xml} — Scilab.java, ConsoleTab.java import
        OS, ScilabCommons, ScilabCommonsUtils, ScilabConstants,
        xml.XConfiguration.
      - org.scilab.modules.graphic_objects.{graphicController,
        graphicObject.GraphicObject,utils} — Scilab.java imports
        GraphicController, GraphicObject, MenuBarBuilder.
      - org.scilab.modules.gui.* (bridge, bridge.console, bridge.tab,
        bridge.window, console, menubar, tab, tabfactory, textbox, toolbar,
        utils) — by far the widest package family here: ScilabTermination,
        SwingView, CallScilabBridge, SwingScilabConsole,
        SwingScilabDockablePanel, SwingScilabWindow, ScilabConsole, MenuBar,
        ScilabMenuBar, ScilabTab, Tab, AbstractScilabTabFactory,
        ScilabTabFactory, ScilabTextBox, TextBox, ToolBar,
        ClosingOperationsManager, ConfigManager, LookAndFeelManager,
        ToolBarBuilder, WindowsConfigurationManager — this module IS the
        application shell gui's Swing widgets get assembled into.
      - org.scilab.modules.jvm.LoadClassPath — Scilab.java.
      - org.scilab.modules.localization.Messages — the usual reactor-sibling
        idiom.
      All six already carry Maven coordinates from Wave A/B/C or earlier;
      none of this wave's work is a new reactor edge, only a new consumer.
    [2] reflection targets — RULED OUT: (none reported, confirmed by a manual
        `grep -rn 'Class\.forName\|loadClass('` sweep of all 3 files — zero
        hits). The two string-literal FQNs that DO appear in this module
        (ConsoleTabFactory.java:32's own `CLASS = "org.scilab.modules.core.
        ConsoleTabFactory"` self-reference, and Scilab.java:65's
        `System.setProperty("java.protocol.handler.pkgs",
        "org.scilab.modules.commons")`, a URL-handler-package registration,
        not a class load) are inert for dependency purposes — the first names
        this module's own class, the second is a system-property VALUE naming
        a package already a direct dependency below, never passed to
        Class.forName/loadClass anywhere in this module.
    [3] fully-qualified uses with no import: org.flexdock.docking.
        {DockingConstants, DockingManager} — confirms real, load-bearing
        vendored usage (not merely an unused import) — see the flexdock
        dependency below. Every other name in this category is one of the
        six reactor packages above spelled out in full elsewhere in
        Scilab.java/ConsoleTab.java, nothing new.
  No manifest.class-path anywhere in build.xml (confirmed again in the
  Ant-built jar's manifest: Class-Path is the literal, never-interpolated
  string "${manifest.class-path}").

  FLEXDOCK — org.flexdock.docking.{DockingConstants, DockingManager},
  ConsoleTab.java's own docking-layout wiring. SAME MECHANISM, SAME
  COORDINATE AS modules/commons/pom.xml (cross-referenced, not restated —
  see that file's <dependencies> comment for the full systemPath-vs-
  alternatives rationale, including the measured file://-repository mirror
  trap and the dated Maven-4 system-scope risk).

  IMPLEMENTATION-VERSION: present, frozen at the literal "00000000 0000",
  positioned between Implementation-Title and Implementation-Vendor exactly
  where Ant's own jar places it (confirmed against modules/core/jar/
  org.scilab.modules.core.jar's actual manifest before extraction: live
  value there was "20260719 1729", a DSTAMP/TSTAMP pair). Vendor string
  double-encoded ("Ã¨", bytes c3 83 c2 a8) — extracted, never retyped (since un-mangled to "è" by register P1), same
  as every other module.
-->
<project xmlns="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0"
         xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
         xsi:schemaLocation="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0 http://maven.apache.org/xsd/maven-4.0.0.xsd">
  <modelVersion>4.0.0</modelVersion>

  <parent>
    <groupId>org.scilab</groupId>
    <artifactId>scilab-modules-parent</artifactId>
    <version>2027.0.0-SNAPSHOT</version>
    <relativePath>../../pom.xml</relativePath>
  </parent>

  <artifactId>core</artifactId>
  <packaging>jar</packaging>

  <!-- build.xml:19 <property name="library.title" value="Scilab application"/> -->
  <name>Scilab application</name>

  <dependencies>
    <!-- org.scilab.modules.action_binding.highlevel.ScilabInterpreterManagement
         — Scilab.java. -->
    <dependency>
      <groupId>org.scilab</groupId>
      <artifactId>action_binding</artifactId>
      <version>${project.version}</version>
    </dependency>
    <!-- org.scilab.modules.commons.{OS, ScilabCommons, ScilabCommonsUtils,
         ScilabConstants, xml.XConfiguration} — Scilab.java, ConsoleTab.java. -->
    <dependency>
      <groupId>org.scilab</groupId>
      <artifactId>commons</artifactId>
      <version>${project.version}</version>
    </dependency>
    <!-- org.scilab.modules.graphic_objects.{graphicController.
         GraphicController, graphicObject.GraphicObject, utils.
         MenuBarBuilder} — Scilab.java. -->
    <dependency>
      <groupId>org.scilab</groupId>
      <artifactId>graphic_objects</artifactId>
      <version>${project.version}</version>
    </dependency>
    <!-- org.scilab.modules.gui.* — the widest package family in this module
         (bridge, bridge.console, bridge.tab, bridge.window, console,
         menubar, tab, tabfactory, textbox, toolbar, utils): this module
         assembles gui's Swing widgets into the actual application shell. -->
    <dependency>
      <groupId>org.scilab</groupId>
      <artifactId>gui</artifactId>
      <version>${project.version}</version>
    </dependency>
    <!-- org.scilab.modules.jvm.LoadClassPath — Scilab.java. -->
    <dependency>
      <groupId>org.scilab</groupId>
      <artifactId>jvm</artifactId>
      <version>${project.version}</version>
    </dependency>
    <!-- org.scilab.modules.localization.Messages — the ordinary
         reactor-sibling idiom used across nearly every module. -->
    <dependency>
      <groupId>org.scilab</groupId>
      <artifactId>localization</artifactId>
      <version>${project.version}</version>
    </dependency>
    <!-- FLEXDOCK — org.flexdock.docking.{DockingConstants, DockingManager},
         ConsoleTab.java's docking-layout wiring. SAME MECHANISM, SAME
         COORDINATE AS modules/commons/pom.xml (cross-referenced, not
         restated — see that file's <dependencies> comment). -->
    <dependency>
      <groupId>org.flexdock</groupId>
      <artifactId>flexdock</artifactId>
      <version>1.2.5</version>
    </dependency>
  </dependencies>

  <build>
    <!-- build.incl.xml:22 <property name="src.dir" location="src/java/"/>.
         Same source tree Ant compiles — see modules/localization/pom.xml's
         identical comment; nothing module-specific to add here. -->
    <sourceDirectory>src/java</sourceDirectory>

    <plugins>
      <plugin>
        <groupId>org.apache.maven.plugins</groupId>
        <artifactId>maven-jar-plugin</artifactId>
        <configuration>
          <archive>
            <!-- addMavenDescriptor=false and the Built-By entry are
                 inherited from the parent POM — not redeclared here. Same
                 manifestFile mechanism as modules/localization/pom.xml (see
                 that file's build comment for the full rationale).
                 MANIFEST-section.MF's bytes were EXTRACTED from the actual
                 Ant-built jar's META-INF/MANIFEST.MF (unzip -p
                 modules/core/jar/org.scilab.modules.core.jar
                 META-INF/MANIFEST.MF), never retyped: Specification-Vendor
                 and Implementation-Vendor both carried (now un-mangled to "è" by register P1) the double-mangled
                 "Ã¨" (bytes c3 83 c2 a8) — see modules/localization/pom.xml's
                 fuller comment for the mechanism. Implementation-Version is
                 present, frozen at the literal "00000000 0000", positioned
                 between Implementation-Title and Implementation-Vendor
                 exactly where Ant places it. -->
            <manifestFile>${project.basedir}/src/main/manifest/MANIFEST-section.MF</manifestFile>
          </archive>
        </configuration>
      </plugin>
    </plugins>
  </build>
</project>
